y, the department offers B.A with major in English, affiliated to Dibrugarh University. The department has three full time faculty and one part time faculty. The department is well equipped with books/library and organizes seminar, workshops on regular basis. We are looking for bright and motivated students who want to take English as a career option.\nFaculties\nMr. Ranjan Nath, HOD\nAsscoiate Professor\nEnglish\nnathranjan36@gmail.com\n7002078742\nRead More\nDr. Archana Saikia\nAsscoiate Professor\nEnglish\n74archanasaikia@gmail.com\n7002136199\nRead More\nDr. Asfi Begum\nAsscoiate Professor\nEnglish\nasfibegum3@gmail.com\n7002947481\nRead More\nCourse Outcomes\n1. H.S in Arts (Under AHSEC)\nFor syllabus click: https://ahsec.assam.gov.in/index.php/syllabus/\n2. B.A major in English (Under Dibrugarh University)\nFor syllabus click: https://dibru.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/B.A-CBCS-English-edited-6th-Dec-2021.pdf\n3.\nClick here to view Course outcomes\nNotifications\nStudent List\nClick here to view document\nActivities by the department\nClass Routine\nContact Us\nprincipal.jgc@gmail.com\nKhumtai, Golaghat, Assam\n(India), Pin – 785619\nQuick Location\nIGNOU\nUniversity Grant Commission\nGetting to NAAC\nDirectorate Of Higher Education\nGuwahati University\nDibrugarh University\nImportant Pages\nAlumni Association\nParent Association\nIQAC\nDHE Updates\nRUSA\nGallery\nDownloads\n© 2025 JOYA GOGOI COLLEGE | All Rights Reserved | Designed by AIO Digital Solutions\nOffice Login\nFaculty Login\nStudent Login\nDigital Diary\nNewsletter\nmodal-check\nDismiss ad\nDismiss ad\nThis will close in\n0\nseconds", "links": [{"label": "+91-9876543210", "url": "tel:+91-9876543210"}, {"label": "principal.jgc@gmail.com", "url": "mailto:principal.jgc@gmail.com"}, {"label": "Office Login", "url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/department-of-english/"}, {"label": "Faculty Login", "url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/department-of-english/"}, {"label": "Student Login", "url": "https://jgcol